501-448e-a6c5-3ecfcf9d6bc8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c9d1ad2a70705b18d07f179e9e9aef38 2x, https://si.imgix.net/71b4f15e/uploads/origins/93272b68-8501-448e-a6c5-3ecfcf9d6bc8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e7a7212a7d25a5ace984247181374c3b 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは！モコウの描き方が大好きです！\n八意永琳と藤原妹紅を一緒に描いてくれませんか？\n口紅のキスの跡がいっぱいついたモコウ(藤原妹紅)が見たいです。\n八意永琳が杢(藤原妹紅)とのキスを終えて、満足そうな顔をしているところ。\n他の選択肢はあなた次第です！", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Rikyo_oekaki/works/7", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/9a9de23f/uploads/origins/a882eb41-6b26-4eeb-bd90-250f3d52b360?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=1fcb4ed288d9f13c83a4d58f2810e440", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/9a9de23f/uploads/origins/a882eb41-6b26-4eeb-bd90-250f3d52b360?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=1fcb4ed288d9f13c83a4d58f2810e440, https://si.imgix.net/9a9de23f/uploads/origins/a882eb41-6b26-4eeb-bd90-250f3d52b360?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=38fef093398c37fce3ce1ca45a8b66c7 2x, https://si.imgix.net/9a9de23f/uploads/origins/a882eb41-6b26-4eeb-bd90-250f3d52b360?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=df3f06e8e3ae212203511fd82ad35890 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Rikyo_oekaki/works/6", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/d47af683/uploads/origins/5e4b4c31-320a-447a-bc5d-18d59b4484d2